      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 06:23:44 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>cnwenzhihong@gmail.com (温志洪)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1895/WzhGameDevPublish/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91/%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6/ue-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>UE 面试准备</h1><p>作者：温志洪（cnwenzhihong@gmail.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="总览">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%80%bb%e8%a7%88"></a>
总览
</h1><h2 id="关键资料与核心思路">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%85%b3%e9%94%ae%e8%b5%84%e6%96%99%e4%b8%8e%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e6%80%9d%e8%b7%af"></a>
关键资料与核心思路
</h2><p><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2014363740011790665">虚幻面试笔记</a><br>
<a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/34721113">《Exploring in UE4》关于网络同步的理解与思考</a><br>
<a href="https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/unreal-engine/gameplay-attributes-and-attribute-sets-for-the-gameplay-ability-system-in-unreal-engine">GAS官方文档</a><br>
<a href="https://github.com/BillEliot/GASDocumentation_Chinese">GASDocumentation_Chinese</a></p>
<h3 id="回答思路">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%9b%9e%e7%ad%94%e6%80%9d%e8%b7%af"></a>
回答思路
</h3>
  <blockquote class="alert-blockquote tip">
    <p class="alert-heading">
      Tip
    </p>
    <p><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span class="line"><span class="cl">输入层：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    玩家按下 Shift
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">GA/GAS 规则层：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    判断能不能 Sprint
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    判断是否消耗体力
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    判断是否禁止开火
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    判断是否和 ADS 互斥
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">Movement 预测层：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    把 Sprint 状态放进 SavedMove / NetworkMoveData
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    保证服务端按同一帧状态重放
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">表现层：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    AnimBP 读取本地预测 Sprint 状态
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    不等待服务器 Tag
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">服务端权威层：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    服务端确认 Ability
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    服务端重放移动
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    不一致则 correction
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">调试层：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    能看到当前 Flags
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    能看到 SavedMove 是否合并
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    能看到服务端是否收到 Sprint 状态
</span></span></code></pre></div></p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-04-26首发于<a href='http://localhost:1895/WzhGameDevPublish/'>妖精游戏开发馆</a>，最后修改于2026-05-01</p>]]>
      </description>
      
    </item>
    
    

